@startuml Checkout Flow - E2E Payment Processing
!pragma teoz true

actor "User" as User
participant "Flutter App\n(CheckoutViewModel)" as Flutter
participant "OrderRepository" as Repo
participant "Cloud Function\ncreate_checkout_session" as CF
participant "Firestore" as DB
participant "Stripe API" as Stripe
participant "Mailjet" as Email
participant "Cloud Function\nstripe_webhook" as Webhook
participant "Cloud Function\nconfirm_order_receipt" as Confirm

autonumber

== Phase 1: Checkout Initiation ==

User -> Flutter: Click "Checkout"
activate Flutter

Flutter -> Flutter: Validate cart items\n(non-empty, stock)

Flutter -> Repo: calculateShipping(items, address)
activate Repo

Repo -> CF: [HTTPS Callable]\ncreate_checkout_session({\n  items, address, userId\n})
activate CF

CF -> CF: Rate limit check\n(5 req/min/user)

CF -> DB: Start transaction
activate DB

CF -> DB: Validate stock for each item\n(atomic check)
DB --> CF: Stock available

CF -> DB: Reserve stock\n(decrement stockQuantity)
DB --> CF: Stock reserved

CF -> DB: Create order document\n(status: pending)
DB --> CF: orderId

deactivate DB

CF -> Stripe: Create Checkout Session\n{\n  mode: payment,\n  capture_method: manual,\n  line_items: [...],\n  metadata: {orderId}\n}
activate Stripe

Stripe --> CF: {\n  sessionId,\n  url: stripe_checkout_url\n}
deactivate Stripe

CF --> Repo: {\n  sessionId,\n  orderId,\n  checkoutUrl\n}
deactivate CF

Repo --> Flutter: CheckoutResult
deactivate Repo

Flutter -> User: Redirect to Stripe Checkout
deactivate Flutter

== Phase 2: Payment Authorization ==

User -> Stripe: Enter card details\n+ Complete payment
activate Stripe

Stripe -> Stripe: Authorize payment\n(hold funds, no capture)

Stripe -> Webhook: [POST] checkout.session.completed\n{\n  event_id,\n  session_id,\n  payment_intent_id\n}
activate Webhook

Webhook -> DB: Check webhook_events/event_id
activate DB
DB --> Webhook: Not exists (idempotent check)

Webhook -> DB: Create webhook_events/event_id\n(prevent reprocessing)
DB --> Webhook: Created
deactivate DB

Webhook -> DB: Update order\n{\n  status: confirmed,\n  paymentStatus: authorized,\n  stripePaymentIntentId,\n  stripeSessionId\n}
activate DB
DB --> Webhook: Updated
deactivate DB

Webhook -> Email: Send order confirmation\n{\n  to: buyer,\n  orderDetails,\n  trackingInfo\n}
activate Email
Email --> Webhook: Email sent
deactivate Email

Webhook -> Email: Send seller notification\n(new order received)
Email --> Webhook: Email sent
deactivate Email

Webhook --> Stripe: 200 OK
deactivate Webhook

Stripe --> User: Payment successful\n(funds authorized)
deactivate Stripe

User -> Flutter: View order details\n(status: confirmed)

note over User, DB
  **Authorization Window: 7 days**
  Funds are held but not captured.
  Seller must ship within 7 days.
  Auto-expiration if not captured.
end note

== Phase 3: Order Fulfillment ==

User -> Flutter: Mark as received\n(after delivery)
activate Flutter

Flutter -> Confirm: [HTTPS Callable]\nconfirm_order_receipt(orderId)
activate Confirm

Confirm -> DB: Get order details
activate DB
DB --> Confirm: Order data\n(paymentIntentId, items, sellers)
deactivate DB

Confirm -> Stripe: Capture Payment Intent\n(release funds)
activate Stripe
Stripe --> Confirm: Payment captured
deactivate Stripe

Confirm -> DB: Update order\n{\n  status: delivered,\n  paymentStatus: captured,\n  deliveryStatus: delivered\n}
activate DB
DB --> Confirm: Updated
deactivate DB

loop For each seller in order
    Confirm -> DB: Create payout record\n{\n  sellerId,\n  amount: sellerTotal - 2.5%,\n  platformFee: 2.5%,\n  status: pending\n}
    activate DB
    DB --> Confirm: Payout created
    deactivate DB
    
    Confirm -> Stripe: Create Transfer\n{\n  destination: seller_account,\n  amount: sellerTotal * 0.975\n}
    activate Stripe
    Stripe --> Confirm: Transfer initiated
    deactivate Stripe
    
    Confirm -> DB: Update payout\n(status: completed)
    activate DB
    DB --> Confirm: Updated
    deactivate DB
end

Confirm --> Flutter: Success
deactivate Confirm

Flutter -> User: Order completed!\n(payout to sellers)
deactivate Flutter

== Phase 4: Auto-Capture (Alternative Path) ==

note over CF, Stripe
  **Cron Job: auto_capture_confirmed_receipts**
  Runs daily at 01:00 UTC
  Captures payments 7 days after delivery
  (if buyer didn't confirm manually)
end note

@enduml
